{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221360","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221360","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322136001:1":{"text":"カレリーナ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>……それに修道者の人もいるということは、生きた屍の浄化の件で来たのね。","source_cn":"卡列琳娜，<style=stress><player_...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2E168392FAD2D2A2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"カレリーナ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>……それに修道者の人もいるということは、生きた屍の浄化の件で来たのね。","female":"カレリーナ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>……それに修道者の人もいるということは、生きた屍の浄化の件で来たのね。","variant_male_record_index":"150916","variant_female_record_index":"150917","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322136002:1":{"text":"はい。こちらのお二人は修道士のオグレさんとマクシムさんです。生きた屍を聖光で浄化する手助けをしてくれるとおっしゃってくれました。","source_cn":"是的，瓦丽卡姐姐。这两位是奥格列修士和马克西姆修士，他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C760EEC4CC3C6E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322136003:1":{"text":"戦士たちを代表してお礼を言うわ。","source_cn":"太好了！我代表那些战士感谢你们的帮助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC0A9F2B70FC9CE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322136004:1":{"text":"あ、あなたは……ああ、デューラ様……あなたは冬の祭典で、カタストロフを倒した英雄として祀られているお方！？","source_cn":"你……你是……艾雅在上，你是冬日祭典纪念的那位、那位打...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF13997AA36FC25C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"